  "prefLabel": "Tra 303.10 Reasonable Access Map",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 303.10 Reasonable Access Map.\n\n(a) The department shall create a map depicting all access routes in the state that are approved, not approved, or approved with conditions.\n\n(b) The map depicting access routes, and any amendments thereto, shall be distributed:\n\n(1) To all affected localities;\n\n(2) To motor vehicle enforcement officials;\n\n(3) To applicants for access routes; and\n\n(4) To any other person upon request.\n\nSource. #12156, eff 4-6-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tra300.html"
}
